11. New 'Check your inbox' screen: masked email, expiry notice, Resend with a 30 second countdown, 'Use a different email', spam-folder tip, 'Back to sign in'.
12. Reset screens: Request (email only) then Check inbox then Set new password (strength meter, show/hide, confirm field) then Success (redirect to sign in).
